Mjollnir, Excalibur, and Snickersnee (among others) get fixed damage
bonuses that apply the same whether they're +0 or +7.  Mjollnir's is
biggest, making it great early on (also, nothing then is electricity
resistant pretty much).  But Excalibur is pretty darned good at +0
too, and holds up better in the late game.


